"Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own." = "会让首次下载增加约 2 GB。它是在软件渲染器上截取的，因此在 GPU 模式下不会被使用——GPU 模式会冷启动一次，然后保存自己的快照。";

